      "content": "It's a common realization that coming to terms with not being exceptional can free you from the exhausting pressure of needing to perform constantly. Remember that simply being present and living day by day is already enough to fill a lifetime with meaning, even without top-tier achievements or recognition. Perhaps today marks a quiet beginning where you stop trying to prove anything and instead just start enjoying the person who stopped grinding for the sake of a game.",
